# Index meaning is the same for every role (the game triggers pick by index):
#   positive: 0 routine success, 1 outstanding result, 2 milestone, 3 recognised by others, 4 pride in the calling
#   negative: 0 failed or flawed work, 1 waste or setback, 2 strain, 3 rejected or ignored, 4 danger or harm
#   social:   0 praised, 1 helped, 2 shared know-how (all +), 3 dispute, 4 betrayal or stolen credit (both -)
# Each entry is (Fact, label, description).

